      statusesExtra: ["Todd is back online! the outage was NOT the site, it was my mom vacuuming near the power strip. new rule: no vacuuming during peak hours (all hours).", "Todd is gently reminding SOME people that 'testing a div overlay' is not a reason to paste 400 lines of CSS into your About Me. the laptop can hear it. you know who you are :)", "Todd is welcoming 13 new members!! that's 38 friends total, which is more than my hard drive was rated for. deleting my own photos to make room. it's fine.", "Todd is defragmenting. the laptop, and also emotionally. back in 20 mins!"],
      banterExtra: {"liz": ["hi liz! welcome!! your layouts are gorgeous. one small thing from your friendly admin: the div overlay on your page is covering the 'log out' button, which is why 40 people have been logged in for 3 days. can we move it? :)", "ok I looked into the layout code thing and yes, kittyxcore's page has your exact CSS, comments and all, including the line that says '/* liz made this dont steal */'. I'm not a lawyer but I am the admin. want me to talk to her? gently?"], "smoove": ["hey smoove! love the energy. your 'new track feat. everyone' is 11MB and it autoplays on 14 profiles, which is why the site sounds like a car stereo right now. could we do a 3MB version? my laptop fan is begging. still a jam!", "you put 'feat. todd' on the track and I want you to know I listened for my part 4 times. I think my part is the dial-up noise at 0:32? I'm honored. I mean it. I'm putting it on the fridge."], "paige": ["welcome paige! your photos are awesome. you've uploaded 212 of them in 3 days, which is a site record, and also why the site was slow on tuesday. can we do a 'best of' album? :) the laptop believes in you.", "'pics or it didn't happen' is a great motto and I want you to know it applies to server outages too. I have a photo of the laptop at 3am. it did happen. it always happens."]},
      banter: {"dave": ["haha love the l33t speak dave! quick note from your friendly site admin: please stop running port scans on the server, it makes my laptop fan really loud and my mom asks about it :)", "welcome aboard buddy! also thank you for the 'security audit' — I have changed the password from password1 to password2. we're basically a fortune 500 now!"], "chad": ["CHAD! welcome to OurSpace! to answer your question: no, you don't have to print out your profile to save it. it stays on the internet all by itself! :)", "great news chad, I fixed it so your caps lock posts don't break the page anymore. never change buddy. GO TEAM!"], "greg": ["hey greg! I added a 'band' category to profiles just for Static Prophecy. that's a real feature I coded at 2am. see you friday at the, uh, venue!", "your demo CD-R arrived! it says 'STATIC PROPHECY - DO NOT COPY' in sharpie, so I made one (1) legal backup. rock on!"], "tina": ["hi tina! love the enthusiasm, but the chain letters are kind of filling up the bulletin server. maybe just... 3 a day? bad luck exemption granted, admin's honor :)", "I reposted your chain letter so nothing bad happens to the site. that's not superstition, that's IT best practices."]},
