      interests: {"General": "writing poetry in eyeliner, 11:11 wishes, glitter that stays on for days (a metaphor), thunderstorms from the porch, black candles from hot topic, the moon (mine. see starxgazer.)", "Music": "my chemical romance (three cheers is a diary), AFI, evanescence, the used, HIM, dashboard confessional when the wound is fresh, one violin note over rain sounds (my song)", "Movies": "the crow, edward scissorhands, interview with the vampire, donnie darko (i understood it. don't ask me to explain it), the nightmare before christmas, obviously", "Television": "invader zim (gir is my heart), daria, buffy (spike era), the addams family reruns at 2am", "Books": "the raven, anything by anne rice, sylvia plath's journals, my own journal (unpublished, too raw), the perks of being a wallflower, coraline", "Heroes": "the moon, edgar allan poe, gerard way, patrick (the only pure thing), whoever invented waterproof mascara (a poet, surely)"},
      pcComments: ["your eyes in this photo hold a sorrow the flash could not wash out. gorgeous. also cute top. xX", "i wrote a haiku for this pic: black hair, black heart / the mall lighting is cruel / you shine anyway. ~*~", "this pic was taken at 11:11, wasn't it. i can tell. the universe is in the timestamp. wish granted.", "the tilt of the camera says 'i am unwell.' the glitter says 'but fabulously.' i have never related to a photo more. 11/11.", "leaving glitter love on this one <3 the void says you photograph beautifully. the void rarely says anything. xX"],
      statusesExtra: ["xX_DarkAngel_Xx has read a certain poem by a certain 'real goth' three times and would like to note that the void does not have a dress code. 'we are not the same.' correct. i am glitterier. xX", "xX_DarkAngel_Xx made a wish at 11:11 and at 11:12 a boy with red hair posted 'some people...' and nothing else, and honestly? most romantic thing i've read all week", "xX_DarkAngel_Xx is writing 'thirteen more shadows' as a sequel. the newcomers keep arriving. the abyss is running out of guestbook.", "xX_DarkAngel_Xx's mascara survived the storm. her heart did not. new blog at midnight. bring tissues. bring kudos. ~*~"],
      banterExtra: {"raven": ["raven. i read your blog. 'we are not the same.' correct. you have bauhaus and i have glitter and both of us have a candle going right now. i'm not your enemy. i'm your sequel. xX", "you called my poems 'hot topic verse' and i'll be honest, i felt that in the hollow of my glitter soul and then i put it in a poem. it's called 'the older girl in black.' it's kind of about you. it's kind of a compliment. 11:11."], "misery": ["misery... six. a name like a spell. you said rawr means i love you in dinosaur. in the language of the void it also means that, but quieter, and it takes longer to say. xX", "your 'first video ever' made me cry and it was 40 seconds of you saying hi to your webcam. that's not a flaw. that's cinema. the abyss gives it two kudos. ~*~"], "nate": ["nate. 'some people...' and then nothing. three dots and a wound. you are a poet and you don't even know it, which is the most poet thing of all. keep bleeding, neon boy. xX", "i read your 'some people...' at 11:11 and made a wish for you. i won't say what. (it was 'get back together with her.' i can't keep secrets before sundown.) ~*~"]},
      banter: {"lucas": ["lucas. your away message was just ellipses and feelings and honestly? it worked. it matters. YOU matter. keep bleeding ink. xX", "11:11... I made a wish that your pain finds a chorus, lucas. it will. probably in drop D. ~*~"], "tina": ["tina. a boy who watches you sleep is not romance, it is a metaphor for the moon. still... Team Edward. we contain multitudes. xX", "I reposted your chain letter at exactly 11:11 so it counts double. the darkness protects its own. ~*~"], "nikki": ["nikki you asked to nightcore my profile song. my song is 6 minutes of rain sounds and one violin note. do your worst, sped-up angel.", "I listened to your remix and cried 1.5x faster than usual. this is a compliment. the glitter tears sting the most. xX"], "sephiroth": ["sephiroth understands. a beautiful man, wronged by the world, one wing... he is basically my poetry journal with a sword. we should talk.", "your 4-page essay made me feel less alone at 11:11. the crater in his heart is the crater in all of us. ~*~ xX"]},
      statuses: ["xX_DarkAngel_Xx is writing a poem about the new members. it is called 'fifteen new shadows at my lunch table.' it is beautiful and devastating.", "xX_DarkAngel_Xx saw 11:11 twice today. the universe is showing off. wish granted, wish pending.", "xX_DarkAngel_Xx is wearing black eyeliner and a smile she will deny. welcome, new souls. the abyss has a guestbook now."],
      bulletins: [{"subject": "~*~ a poem for the newcomers ~*~", "body": "fifteen candles flicker in the dark of the friend request queue / your profiles load slowly, like grief, or dial-up / welcome to the beautiful wreckage we call home / leave a comment. leave a scar. leave your top 8 open for me. / (repost this at 11:11 or don't. the void reposts nothing, and look how mysterious it is.) xX", "time": "Jun 23 2026 11:11 PM"}],
