      statuses: ["patrick is happy because there are 15 new friends. that's almost as many fingers as i have, plus more", "patrick read every new person's profile three times. they are all so cool. dwayne agrees (he's my rock)", "patrick is having a good day. the sun is out and my friend count went up and mom made spaghetti"],
