      pcComments: ["the lighting in this pic is SO venus in leo. you didn't know that. now you do. gorgeous", "i can tell your rising sign from this angle. libra. the tilt of the head gave it away. don't argue with the sky", "this was taken during a waxing moon and it SHOWS. you look like you're about to get what you want. comment back when it happens", "ok the eyeliner in this one is a scorpio moon situation and i say that with love and also fear. stunning", "i love this pic!! also pluto was transiting your 1st house when you took it, which explains the hair. the hair is a transit. the hair is beautiful"],
      statusesExtra: ["starxgazer did 13 more charts tonight. new record: three taurus in one friend group (bryan, kayla, and the drummer's drum, which is also a taurus). the band drama makes sense now", "starxgazer would like to note that a CERTAIN someone changed their relationship status three times during a mercury retrograde and then blamed 'him.' babe. blame mercury. he's right there. he's used to it", "starxgazer is watching the full moon in aquarius from the roof and every scene kid on this site posted a 'some people...' bulletin at the same minute. the stars don't miss. neither do i", "starxgazer did malten's chart AGAIN and it's still aries. i checked three times. patrick helped. it's aries all the way down"],
      banterExtra: {"lexi": ["lexi babe i did your chart and nate's chart and put them side by side and i need you to sit down. your venus and his mars are square. that's not bad, it's just LOUD. it's why the status changes every week. the sky did it. not you", "ok listen: mercury goes direct on the 9th. do NOT change the status before the 9th. if you change it after the 9th, that one counts. i'm not your mom, i'm just the messenger for a very large planet"], "bryan": ["bryan. taurus. i KNEW it. i told greg 'your drummer is a taurus, he'll resist,' and then you resisted, and now you're on this site not texting anyone back. taurus. classic. beautiful. text her back", "'idk anymore' is the most taurus away message i have ever read and i've read thousands. the stars say: you DO know. you just don't want to move. the moon's in your 3rd house friday, that's the texting house. use it"], "kittyxcore": ["kittyxcore your top 8 is arranged by who commented your pics most recently and i can tell from HERE. that's a gemini move. you're not a gemini. you're a leo. leos want it earned. put lexi back at #1", "did your chart from your pc4pc bulletin alone: leo sun, pisces moon (the hello kitty of moons), aries rising. you're not fighting brittany over the top 8. you're fighting a mirror. the stars said it, not me"]},
      banter: {"sephiroth": ["did your chart, sephiroth. scorpio sun, leo rising, drama in EVERY house. the one-winged thing? classic scorpio. you didn't ask. you never have to. i'm right", "mercury enters your 9th house friday, which rules Long Essays. brace yourselves everyone, his lore posts are about to get LONGER. the stars apologize in advance"], "tony": ["tony i looked at your venus and it explains SO much. libra venus: zero shame, infinite hope. the stars say keep trying. the stars are also laughing. warmly", "your chart literally has 'hey ;)' energy in all 12 houses. astrologically undeterred. i've never seen anything like it. i'm presenting you at my next chart club meeting"], "brittany": ["brittany babe the top 8 drama is NOT your fault, mercury is retrograde and your 11th house (friendship!!) is hosting a whole planetary party. reshuffle after the 9th, trust me", "did your chart from your 'text me!!' post alone. gemini moon. i knew before i knew. you heart everything because your moon needs everyone to feel seen. it's beautiful actually"], "greg": ["greg i checked friday's transits for the show. waxing moon in leo = PERFORMANCE ENERGY. also 60% chance your dad's car has to move first. the stars see all", "static prophecy?? greg, the band name is basically an astrology term already. your mars says open the set with the second song. tell the drummer. he's a taurus, he'll resist"]},
      statuses: ["starxgazer has done 9 of the 15 new members' charts already. nobody asked. everybody needed it. 6 to go", "starxgazer: mercury retrograde ends thursday, which explains todd's server, brittany's top 8, and my mood. the stars keep receipts", "starxgazer is charging her crystals on the windowsill and reordering her top 8 by rising sign. it's the only fair way"],
      bulletins: [{"subject": "NEW MEMBERS: your charts are done (you're welcome)", "body": "hi loves. i did birth charts for all 15 new members using your profile info, your posting times, and auras (auras are data). results so far: four scorpios (sephiroth, we KNOW), one triple gemini (riley, obviously), and chad, whose chart is just the sun. it's all sun. comment your birthday for the full reading, or don't — i'll figure it out from your bulletin reposts. i always do. the stars don't miss. xoxo, star", "time": "Jun 30 2026 10:10 PM"}],
