      interests: {"General": "fields, lights in the sky (unrelated to me), consuming nutrients, standing in fields, staring at the sky POINTEDLY, book club (real), the microwave (under study), counting the members (there are 38)", "Music": "the hum of power lines, the beastie boys (intergalactic is a normal song i like for normal reasons), nikki's 'crop circles' remix (she does not know it is that), enya, the theme from the x-files (a comedy)", "Movies": "e.t. (inaccurate. moving. inaccurate), men in black (a documentary. i mean a comedy), independence day (rude), signs (the water thing is CORRECT and i will say no more), contact (the human jodie foster understands)", "Television": "the x-files (fiction. all fiction), unsolved mysteries (also fiction), the weather channel (i am learning what 'partly cloudy' means for the cover), spongebob (patrick is in it. we have discussed this)", "Books": "the human field guide to birds (for cover), how to win friends and influence people (it is working), the phone book (a list of all humans, very efficient), the microwave manual", "Heroes": "[REDACTED BY ZORP], patrick (waves), todd (keeps the server on a 'laptop,' which is very brave), the human 'tom' (tracks everyone. respect), the moon (a colleague)"},
      pcComments: ["an excellent photograph of your human face. all features present and in the correct number. i have filed it. for enjoyment", "your hair in this image is very tall. is it an antenna. it is not. i know that. i was testing you. good hair", "this picture was taken at night, outside, near a field. i see nothing unusual in the sky behind you. nothing. do not zoom in", "the flash of the camera has revealed that you have two eyes, which is the normal amount, which i also have. we are the same. nice pic", "you are 'making a face' in this one. i have practiced this face in the mirror. mine is not as good. teach me. for normal reasons"],
      statusesExtra: ["zorp_51 attended youth group. there was pizza and a human named josh who beat me at 'halo' 9 times. i was not trying. i was gathering data. i was trying a little", "zorp_51 has noticed a certain human photographs everything with a fish-eye lens. a fish. eye. why do you have the eye of a fish. and why does it keep pointing at me. no reason. normal question", "zorp_51 welcomes the 13 new humans. i have counted them. 13. that makes 38. i am very normal about counting and this number is fine. 38 is fine", "zorp_51 is awake at 3:33 AM again for the normal reason (snacks). the lights over the field at 3:33 AM are also snacks. for someone else. unrelated"],
      banterExtra: {"paige": ["paige. your photographs of the 'sesh' are excellent documentation of human activity. however i have appeared in the background of 4 of them and in one my shadow is the wrong shape. delete that one. i mean, do not. it is a normal shadow", "you say 'pics or it didn't happen.' i agree. many things did not happen. the lights over the field did not happen. i have no pics. therefore. thank you for confirming this with your own rule"], "josh": ["hello josh. you invited me to 'youth group' and said 'it's chill.' i attended. it was in fact chill (68 degrees, i checked). there was pizza and singing and no one asked where i was from. i will return. this is not a study", "you beat me at halo 9 times and then said 'good game' each time as if it were true. this is a human kindness i have not previously catalogued. i have added it to the file. the file is for enjoyment"], "epic": ["epic_faic. your profile picture is a round purple face with no body. i was told this is a 'meme.' i have asked no follow-up questions. it is a very normal face. i also have a face. it is this one. hello", "you said 'lol ur mom is an alien' to me. ha. ha. this is a fun human joke. it is not accurate. my mother is a normal human woman who lives in a normal field. do not visit the field"]},
      banter: {"usagi": ["greetings usagi. i too am learning earth languages from the television programs. it is a normal way to learn. we are both normal. your progress is adequate-superb", "a question from a normal human: when you say 'subs not dubs,' i agree strongly. the original audio contains important data— i mean, feelings. yes. feelings"], "dave": ["hello dave. you say you could 'hack this site.' haha. a fun human joke. there is nothing hidden on my profile. do not scan it. this is a normal request between web-friends", "i attended your LAN party in spirit (my physical form was recharg— sleeping. normally. in a bed). your packets were delicious. i mean fast. fast packets"], "meg": ["meg your horse drawings are excellent documentation of the earth creature 'horse.' i have filed them. for enjoyment. humans file things for enjoyment, yes? yes", "a unicorn is simply a horse with an antenna. you understand more than the others, meg. i will say no more at this time"], "chad": ["chad i have studied the baseball. a human throws the small moon, another human deflects it with a club, and everyone is happy for him. i am also happy for him. GO TEAM (this is correct usage yes?)", "you said i should 'come to a game sometime.' i will attend. i will eat one (1) hot dog like everyone else and make the crowd sounds at the correct moments. it will be extremely normal"]},
      statuses: ["zorp_51 is awake at 3:33 AM for normal human reasons (snacks. earth snacks)", "zorp_51 welcomes the 15 new humans. i have counted them several times. there are 15. i am very normal about counting", "zorp_51 enjoyed the sun today from a safe distance, as all humans do"],
      bulletins: [{"subject": "SURVEY FOR HUMANS (i am also one)", "body": "hello web-friends. a normal survey, as is the custom. 1) how many hours do you sleep? (i sleep the regular amount. 8. in a bed. horizontally.) 2) favorite earth food? (mine is also pizza.) 3) when you look at the night sky, do you ever feel homesi— nostalgic? for no reason? haha. same. 4) top 8 or top 25? repost so i may gather da— so we may all have fun together. thank you. i am zorp, a human. p.s. the july 4 fireworks are not signals. do not reply to them.", "time": "Jul 2 2026 3:33 AM"}],
